      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "notebook",
      "description": "The white ruled writing surface; rings and shadow stay outside the torn page.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notebook-wrap\"><div class=\"ds-rings ds-rings-back\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><section class=\"ds-notebook\"><h2 class=\"ds-notebook-title\">Nossos combinados</h2><label class=\"ds-notebook-label\" for=\"ds-title\">Nome do sorteio</label><input id=\"ds-title\" class=\"ds-notebook-input\" value=\"Amigo secreto da turma\"/></section><div class=\"ds-rings ds-rings-front\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-notebook-wrap{filter:drop-shadow(2px 8px 9px rgb(64 53 38 / 12%))}.ds-notebook{background-color:var(--paper,#fffefb);background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 44px,var(--margin,#d79897) 44px,var(--margin,#d79897) 45px,transparent 45px),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0,transparent 31px,var(--rule,#c4d4ec) 31px,var(--rule,#c4d4ec) 32px);background-position:0 0,0 13px;padding:30px 28px 29px 66px;clip-path:polygon(0 0.45%, 1.5% 0, 3% 0.35%, 5% 0.1%, 7% 0.5%, 10% 0.25%, 14% 0.4%, 18% 0, 22% 0.3%, 27% 0.15%, 33% 0.5%, 38% 0, 45% 0.3%, 51% 0.15%, 57% 0.35%, 65% 0, 72% 0.4%, 78% 0.2%, 84% 0, 91% 0.3%, 97% 0.1%, 100% 0.3%, 99.8% 12%, 100% 23%, 99.75% 36%, 100% 48%, 99.8% 61%, 100% 72%, 99.7% 87%, 100% 99.4%, 98.5% 99.8%, 96.7% 99.3%, 94.4% 100%, 92.3% 99.5%, 89.5% 99.9%, 87.3% 99.2%, 84.7% 99.7%, 82% 99.3%, 78.6% 100%, 76% 99.4%, 72.5% 99.8%, 70.6% 99.1%, 68.4% 99.7%, 65.8% 99.4%, 62% 99.9%, 59.4% 99.2%, 57% 99.6%, 53.5% 99.4%, 49.9% 100%, 47.7% 99.6%, 44.2% 99.8%, 41.3% 99.1%, 38.7% 99.7%, 35% 99.3%, 32.5% 99.9%, 29.3% 99.4%, 26.6% 99.8%, 24.1% 99.2%, 21% 99.7%, 18.8% 99.4%, 15.1% 100%, 12% 99.4%, 9.5% 99.8%, 6.6% 99.2%, 4.4% 99.7%, 2% 99.4%, 0 99.7%, 0.3% 86%, 0 73%, 0.2% 61%, 0 47%, 0.25% 35%, 0 22%, 0.2% 10%)}.ds-notebook-title{font-family:var(--font-handwriting,\"Caveat\"),cursive;font-size:39px;font-weight:500;line-height:48px;margin:0 0 23px;color:var(--ink,#2146a0);transform:rotate(-1deg)}.ds-notebook-label{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Public Sans\"),sans-serif;display:inline-block;background:var(--paper,#fffefb);box-shadow:5px 0 var(--paper,#fffefb),-5px 0 var(--paper,#fffefb);color:#515968;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:8px}.ds-notebook-input{font-family:var(--font-handwriting,\"Caveat\"),cursive;width:100%;min-width:0;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:0 0 2px;color:var(--ink,#2146a0);font-size:28px;font-weight:500;line-height:32px}.ds-notebook-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#2146a0);outline-offset:3px}.ds-notebook-wrap{position:relative;isolation:isolate;margin-left:6px}.ds-notebook{position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:260px}.ds-rings{position:absolute;left:-13px;top:29px;bottom:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;pointer-events:none}.ds-rings i{width:31px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-10deg)}.ds-rings-back{z-index:0}.ds-rings-back i{border:3px solid #7d7d76;border-right-color:#d4d3ca;border-top-color:#a7a69e;box-shadow:0 2px 2px rgb(56 52 45 / 24%)}.ds-rings-front{z-index:2}.ds-rings-front i{position:relative}.ds-rings-front i::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid #7d7d76;border-right-color:#d4d3ca;border-top-color:#a7a69e;box-shadow:0 2px 2px rgb(56 52 45 / 24%);clip-path:inset(46% -4px -5px -4px)}.ds-rings-front i::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-1px;top:4px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#6b685f;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px #3e3d36,0 0 0 1px #f1eee5}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Two-Fold Ticket Fallback",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "folded-ticket",
      "description": "Closed quarter-width CSS fallback material preview; production uses dynamic Three.js physical UV geometry and the same two-step reveal.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strip-scene\"><div class=\"ds-strip-measure\"><div class=\"ds-strip-flat\"></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-strip-hit\" aria-label=\"Abrir dobra 1 de 2\"></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-strip-scene{height:230px;width:100%;position:relative}.ds-strip-measure{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:clamp(160px,calc(100% - 32px),420px);aspect-ratio:3.9;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-1.43deg)}.ds-strip-flat{width:25%;height:100%;margin:auto;background:var(--paper,#fffefb) linear-gradient(transparent 33%,#b3c5e4 33%,#b3c5e4 calc(33% + 1px),transparent calc(33% + 1px),transparent 68%,#b3c5e4 68%,#b3c5e4 calc(68% + 1px),transparent calc(68% + 1px));clip-path:polygon(0 0.45%, 1.5% 0, 3% 0.35%, 5% 0.1%, 7% 0.5%, 10% 0.25%, 14% 0.4%, 18% 0, 22% 0.3%, 27% 0.15%, 33% 0.5%, 38% 0, 45% 0.3%, 51% 0.15%, 57% 0.35%, 65% 0, 72% 0.4%, 78% 0.2%, 84% 0, 91% 0.3%, 97% 0.1%, 100% 0.3%, 99.8% 12%, 100% 23%, 99.75% 36%, 100% 48%, 99.8% 61%, 100% 72%, 99.7% 87%, 100% 99.4%, 98.5% 99.8%, 96.7% 99.3%, 94.4% 100%, 92.3% 99.5%, 89.5% 99.9%, 87.3% 99.2%, 84.7% 99.7%, 82% 99.3%, 78.6% 100%, 76% 99.4%, 72.5% 99.8%, 70.6% 99.1%, 68.4% 99.7%, 65.8% 99.4%, 62% 99.9%, 59.4% 99.2%, 57% 99.6%, 53.5% 99.4%, 49.9% 100%, 47.7% 99.6%, 44.2% 99.8%, 41.3% 99.1%, 38.7% 99.7%, 35% 99.3%, 32.5% 99.9%, 29.3% 99.4%, 26.6% 99.8%, 24.1% 99.2%, 21% 99.7%, 18.8% 99.4%, 15.1% 100%, 12% 99.4%, 9.5% 99.8%, 6.6% 99.2%, 4.4% 99.7%, 2% 99.4%, 0 99.7%, 0.3% 86%, 0 73%, 0.2% 61%, 0 47%, 0.25% 35%, 0 22%, 0.2% 10%);filter:drop-shadow(2px 6px 7px rgb(64 53 38 / 18%));transition:width .2s}.ds-strip-hit{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:transparent;border:0;padding:0;cursor:grab;touch-action:pan-y;user-select:none}.ds-strip-hit:active{cursor:grabbing}.ds-strip-hit:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#2146a0);outline-offset:-6px}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-strip-scene{height:200px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-strip-flat{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Copy Confirmation",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Confirmed state inside the same copy button for 2.5 seconds; no new layout row.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-copy ds-secondary\" aria-label=\"Mensagem de Marina copiada\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg><span>Copiada</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Public Sans\"),sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:11px 19px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;transition:background 160ms,box-shadow 160ms;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#2146a0);border-color:#7f8caa}.ds-secondary:hover{background:#d8dfec}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#2146a0);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-secondary:active{background:#d8dfec}.ds-secondary:disabled{background:transparent;border-color:#a8a9a7;color:#656a73;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none}}.ds-copy{min-width:158px;min-height:40px;padding:9px 13px;gap:8px;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-copy{min-width:0;flex:1}}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-copy{min-height:44px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "O ritual do papelzinho",
    "overview": "Notebook pages and loose slips make the familiar amigo secreto ritual tangible: write with a blue ballpoint pen, tear a horizontal strip by hand, fold it twice along vertical creases and open it to discover a name. The material world is light kraft with visible fibers, near-white ruled paper and imperfect blue writing. Shadows, creases and small rotations describe actual pieces of paper.\n\nCaveat carries handwriting; Public Sans keeps controls and instructions clear. Copy is direct, conversational Brazilian Portuguese. The organizer works on an open notebook, while the recipient gets a focused paper interaction. The confirmed background is pale, desaturated kraft; gray and orange backing are rejected.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light kraft backing with visible natural fibers.",
      "White ruled notebook paper, a red margin and jagged hand-torn edges.",
      "Subtle blue ballpoint coverage with small pigment skips and pressure variation.",
      "Two deliberate opening steps with touch, tap and keyboard access.",
      "Plain pt-BR instructions and legible Public Sans controls."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Light Kraft Rule",
        "body": "Keep the photographic fibers visible under the light overlay. Preserve the pale, desaturated backing chosen by the user.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ink Boundary Rule",
        "body": "Apply pigment loss to the writing, keeping paper fills and ruling on unfiltered wrappers. Disable ink filtering when more contrast is requested, or on the specific lettering being selected.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Physical Paper Rule",
        "body": "Use creases, torn silhouettes, layered sheet edges and ambient shadows to explain the paper object and its state.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep kraft light and visibly fibrous behind near-white paper.",
      "Do use Caveat for written names and Public Sans for functional labels and instructions.",
      "Do keep paper backgrounds outside the ballpoint filter.",
      "Do preserve both vertical folds, with tap and keyboard alternatives to dragging.",
      "Do retain visible focus, live status messages, reduced-motion handling and coarse-pointer targets.",
      "Do write concrete, conversational Brazilian Portuguese."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the chosen backing with gray or orange kraft.",
      "Don't replace the paper ritual with gift mascots, generic dashboard cards, serif marketing headings or eyebrow labels.",
      "Don't make vibration or dragging necessary to reveal a name.",
      "Don't imply that opening WhatsApp confirms delivery; the sent checkbox is local to the current screen.",
      "Don't treat the paper as a rounded app card or apply ink failures to its surface."
    ]
  }
}
